Strictly speaking, you can't do that with "lu" and "li'u" either. For
example, in "zo lu .e zo li'u valsi", "lu" and "li'u" are not quoting
anything, so an automatic punctuator that didn't know how to parse the
sentence would get it wrong. Admittedly you probably won't find many such
cases in practice.

